          "normalized_summary": "A large international study suggests that very high p-tau217 levels may identify cognitively healthy adults who face a substantially greater chance of impairment years later. A person can appear cognitively healthy while carrying biological changes linked to a greater chance of future cognitive decline. An international study led by researchers at the Mass General Brigham [...]",
